        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "For behold, as yet, ye have been obedient unto the word of the Lord, which I have given unto you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:4",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "But behold, hearken ye unto me, and know that by the help of the all-powerful Creator of heaven and earth I can tell you concerning your thoughts, how that ye are beginning to labor in sin, which sin appeareth very abominable unto me, yea, and abominable unto God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 137,
            "end": 145,
            "text": "Amos 4:13; Alma 12:3 (3–7); D&C 6:16. TG God, Omniscience of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:5",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, it grieveth my soul and causeth me to shrink with shame before the presence of my Maker, that I must testify unto you concerning the wickedness of your hearts.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:6",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And also it grieveth me that I must use so much boldness of speech concerning you, before your wives and your children, many of whose feelings are exceedingly tender and chaste and delicate before God, which thing is pleasing unto God;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 56,
            "text": "Lev. 19:17; D&C 121:43."
          },
          {
            "start": 170,
            "end": 176,
            "text": "TG Chastity."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Lev. 19:17; D&C 121:43.",
            "prettyString": "Leviticus 19:17; D&C 121:43",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "leviticus",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 19,
                    "end": 19,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 17,
                        "end": 17
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "doctrineandcovenants",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 121,
                    "end": 121,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 43,
                        "end": 43
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "raw": "TG Chastity.",
            "prettyString": "TG Chastity",
            "references": [
