        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "But before ye seek for riches, seek ye for the kingdom of God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 10,
            "text": "Mark 10:24 (17–27)."
          },
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 3:11 (11–13); Prov. 27:24 (24–27); 2 Ne. 26:31; Alma 39:14; D&C 6:7. TG Worldliness."
          },
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 54,
            "text": "Luke 12:31 (22–31)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:18",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And after ye have obtained a hope in Christ ye shall obtain riches, if ye seek them; and ye will seek them for the intent to do good—to clothe the naked, and to feed the hungry, and to liberate the captive, and administer relief to the sick and the afflicted.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 125,
            "end": 127,
            "text": "Mosiah 4:26; 3 Ne. 12:42; 4 Ne. 1:3. TG Good Works."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:19",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And now, my brethren, I have spoken unto you concerning pride; and those of you which have afflicted your neighbor, and persecuted him because ye were proud in your hearts, of the things which God hath given you, what say ye of it?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:20",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Do ye not suppose that such things are abominable unto him who created all flesh? And the one being is as precious in his sight as the other. And all flesh is of the dust; and for the selfsame end hath he created them, that they should keep his commandments and glorify him forever.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 245,
            "end": 257,
            "text": "D&C 11:20; Abr. 3:25 (25–26)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:21",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And now I make an end of speaking unto you concerning this pride. And were it not that I must speak unto you concerning a grosser crime, my heart would rejoice exceedingly because of you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:22",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "But the word of God burdens me because of your grosser crimes. For behold, thus saith the Lord: This people begin to wax in iniquity; they understand not the scriptures, for they seek to excuse themselves in committing whoredoms, because of the things which were written concerning David, and Solomon his son.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 219,
            "end": 228,
            "text": "TG Whore."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Whore.",
            "prettyString": "TG Whore",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Whore",
                "entryId": "tg-whore",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Jacob 2:23",
        "book": "Jacob",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, David and Solomon truly had many wives and concubines, which thing was abominable before me, saith the Lord.",
